# Physics — {{PROJECT_TITLE}}

The governing physics for this project (shared by all its campaigns): the foundational reference the loop-running agent consults to
reason about the metric, the levers, and what results are physically possible. Built from user-provided
information, user-provided literature, and (if enabled) a targeted literature search. **Length varies
dramatically** with the problem and how much the user supplies — a paragraph or many pages.

**Living document.** Update it whenever a campaign discovery changes the physical understanding (add the
new effect, its equations, and the literature consulted — see the loop's UPDATE step in `charter.md`).

> Notation: write all equations in math blocks (`$$ … $$` for display, `$…$` inline) with **precise,
> well-defined symbols and units**. Define every symbol the first time it appears.

